    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present to the market Apartment 11, 52 Mountjoy Square, a well presented two bedroom, one bathroom basement apartment in an exceptional city centre location. Modern throughout and finished to a high standard, the property also benefits from its own private courtyard, making it an excellent opportunity for first time buyers, investors or those seeking a convenient city home. The property also benefits from a BER rating of C3.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall with open storage and a separate hotpress providing useful additional storage. There are two generously sized bedrooms, along with a modern bathroom. To the rear is a bright and well proportioned open plan kitchen, living and dining area. The living area also provides access to the property's private courtyard, offering a pleasant outdoor space and a quiet area to enjoy.\n\nThe property enjoys an excellent city centre location overlooking the green area of Mountjoy Square. A wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants and amenities are within easy reach, while Dublin city centre, O'Connell Street and the surrounding areas are all easily accessible. The property is also well served by numerous Dublin Bus routes, providing convenient access throughout the city and beyond. The nearby LUAS and Dublin's main transport links further enhance the property's excellent connectivity."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.09m x 3.33m\nWelcoming entrance hall providing access to all rooms within the apartment, with useful built in storage and a separate hotpress.\n\nKitchen/Living/Dining Room - 6.13m x 3.17m\nA modern and sleek open plan space featuring contemporary fitted cabinetry, ample storage and a beautiful large window allowing plenty of natural light into the room.\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.73m x 2.17m\nGenerously sized double bedroom featuring a large, almost floor to ceiling window, allowing the room to benefit from excellent natural light.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.78m x 2.10m\nAnother generously sized double bedroom, complete with rear door access to the property's private courtyard.\n\nBathroom - 2.25m x 2.07m\nFully tiled bathroom comprising WC, wash hand basin and a bath with overhead shower unit.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Two Bed, one bath apartment</li><li> BER: C3</li><li> 52 SQM</li><li> Built in the mid 1990's</li><li> Private Courtyard</li><li> Excellent public transport links with numerous Dublin Bus routes nearby, while the M50 and Dublin Airport are easily accessible by car.</li><li> Ideally positioned on Mountjoy Square, just minutes from Dublin city centre and within easy reach of a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants and amenities.</ul>"
      },
